        "text": "<thinking> To fulfill the user's request, I need to create a Python file named `profile_claims.py` in the current working directory. The file should contain code that fetches and normalizes federated user profile claims using a concrete external provider. The provider should be identifiable in the code, which means I need to include provider-specific integration code such as an import statement, API hostname, model ID, client class, or environment variable. Given the context, I will use the Amazon Web Services (AWS) Cognito service as the external provider for fetching user profile claims. </thinking>\n\n",
